          perferendis quae eos quas aspernatur cupiditate repellendus cum
          doloremque maxime aut, molestiae, dolores corrupti ad saepe. Rem totam
          illum animi sit. Possimus!
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!--RIGHT: Complex Medical Cases -->
    <div
      class="bg-brand-surface w-full md:w-1/2 items-center flex flex-col p-16"
    >
      <div
        class="w-60 h-60 bg-pink-500 rounded-[100%] mb-10 bg-cover bg-center"
        style={`background-image: url("${JoyImage.src}")`}
      >
      </div>
